    "text": "<h2>Ініціалізація додатоку</h2>\r\n<div>Тепер ви можете побачити наш HTML-макет із пов’язаними необхідними файлами CSS і JavaScript. Тепер ми повинні ініціалізувати наш додаток (наприклад, у my-app.js):</div>\r\n<pre><code>var app = new Techno4();</code></pre>\r\n<div>У наведеному вище прикладі ми використовуємо змінну програми, де зберігаємо ініціалізований екземпляр Techno4 для легкого доступу в майбутньому. Не обов’язково називати додаток App, вона може бути будь-якою.\r\nЦе було досить просто. Але Techno4 також забезпечує більше налаштувань ініціалізації, передаючи об’єкт із параметрами:\r\n</div>\r\n<pre><code>var app = new Techno4({\r\n  routes: [\r\n    {\r\n      name: 'about',\r\n      path: '/about/',\r\n      url: './pages/about.html',\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      name: 'news',\r\n      path: '/news/',\r\n      url: './pages/news.html',\r\n      options: {\r\n        animate: false,\r\n      },\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      name: 'users',\r\n      path: '/users/',\r\n      componentUrl: './pages/users.html',\r\n      options: {\r\n        props: {\r\n          users: ['Techno Wizard', 'Taras Shtempo'],\r\n        },\r\n      },\r\n      on: {\r\n        pageAfterIn: function test (e, page) {\r\n          // do something after page gets into the view\r\n        },\r\n        pageInit: function (e, page) {\r\n          // do something when page initialized\r\n        },\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    // Default route, match to all pages (e.g. 404 page)\r\n    {\r\n      path: '(.*)',\r\n      url: './pages/404.html',\r\n    },\r\n  ],\r\n});\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<div>Щоб переглянути список усіх доступних параметрів програми, перегляньте розділ Додаток/ Ядро </div>\r\n<div>Після ініціалізації програми нам потрібно ініціалізувати представлення (<div class=\"view view-main\">\r\n</div>\r\n<pre><code>&lt;div class=&quot;view view-main&quot;&gt;</code></pre>\r\n<div>у макеті програми). По суті View — це маршрутизатор програми, який відповідає за навігацію:</div>\r\n<pre><code>var mainView = app.views.create('.view-main');\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<div>Отже, ваш остаточний код ініціалізації в my-app.js може виглядати так:\r\n</div>\r\n<pre><code>var app = new Techno4({\r\n  // App root element\r\n  el: '#app',\r\n  // App Name\r\n  name: 'My App',\r\n  // App id\r\n  id: 'com.myapp.test',\r\n  // Enable swipe panel\r\n  panel: {\r\n    swipe: true,\r\n  },\r\n  // Add default routes\r\n  routes: [\r\n    {\r\n      path: '/about/',\r\n      url: 'about.html',\r\n    },\r\n  ],\r\n  // ... other parameters\r\n});\r\n\r\nvar mainView = app.views.create('.view-main');\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<h2>Що далі?</h2>\r\n<div>Гаразд, тепер ми знаємо, як створювати і запускати програму. Тепер нам потрібно перевірити компонент App / Core, щоб дізнатися більше про його параметри та методи, як працює Router, дізнатися більше про Views, Pages та інші компоненти.\r\n</div>\r\n <!-- {\"type\":\"layout\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"section\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"general\",\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"style\":\"primary\",\"title_breakpoint\":\"xl\",\"title_position\":\"top-left\",\"title_rotation\":\"left\",\"vertical_align\":\"middle\",\"width\":\"large\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"row\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"column\",\"props\":{\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"position_sticky_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"preserve_color\":true,\"style\":\"tile-muted\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"headline\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u0406\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u044f \\u0434\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e\\u043a\\u0443\",\"title_element\":\"h2\",\"title_style\":\"heading-small\"},\"name\":\"\\u0417\\u0430\\u0433\\u043e\\u043b\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u043a\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"row\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"column\",\"props\":{\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"position_sticky_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"style\":\"tile-default\",\"width_medium\":\"3-4\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u0422\\u0435\\u043f\\u0435\\u0440 \\u0432\\u0438 \\u043c\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0431\\u0430\\u0447\\u0438\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0448 HTML-\\u043c\\u0430\\u043a\\u0435\\u0442 \\u0456\\u0437 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0432\\u2019\\u044f\\u0437\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u043c\\u0438 \\u043d\\u0435\\u043e\\u0431\\u0445\\u0456\\u0434\\u043d\\u0438\\u043c\\u0438 \\u0444\\u0430\\u0439\\u043b\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438 CSS \\u0456 JavaScript. \\u0422\\u0435\\u043f\\u0435\\u0440 \\u043c\\u0438 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0432\\u0438\\u043d\\u043d\\u0456 \\u0456\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u0443\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0448 \\u0434\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e\\u043a (\\u043d\\u0430\\u043f\\u0440\\u0438\\u043a\\u043b\\u0430\\u0434, \\u0443 my-app.js):\",\"margin\":\"default\",\"text_style\":\"large\"},\"name\":\"\\u041e\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\"},{\"type\":\"code\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"var app = new Techno4();\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u0423 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0432\\u0435\\u0434\\u0435\\u043d\\u043e\\u043c\\u0443 \\u0432\\u0438\\u0449\\u0435 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0438\\u043a\\u043b\\u0430\\u0434\\u0456 \\u043c\\u0438 \\u0432\\u0438\\u043a\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u0432\\u0443\\u0454\\u043c\\u043e \\u0437\\u043c\\u0456\\u043d\\u043d\\u0443 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438, \\u0434\\u0435 \\u0437\\u0431\\u0435\\u0440\\u0456\\u0433\\u0430\\u0454\\u043c\\u043e \\u0456\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0435\\u043a\\u0437\\u0435\\u043c\\u043f\\u043b\\u044f\\u0440 Techno4 \\u0434\\u043b\\u044f \\u043b\\u0435\\u0433\\u043a\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0434\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0443\\u043f\\u0443 \\u0432 \\u043c\\u0430\\u0439\\u0431\\u0443\\u0442\\u043d\\u044c\\u043e\\u043c\\u0443. \\u041d\\u0435 \\u043e\\u0431\\u043e\\u0432\\u2019\\u044f\\u0437\\u043a\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e \\u043d\\u0430\\u0437\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0434\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e\\u043a App, \\u0432\\u043e\\u043d\\u0430 \\u043c\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435 \\u0431\\u0443\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0431\\u0443\\u0434\\u044c-\\u044f\\u043a\\u043e\\u044e.\\n\\u0426\\u0435 \\u0431\\u0443\\u043b\\u043e \\u0434\\u043e\\u0441\\u0438\\u0442\\u044c \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e. \\u0410\\u043b\\u0435 Techno4 \\u0442\\u0430\\u043a\\u043e\\u0436 \\u0437\\u0430\\u0431\\u0435\\u0437\\u043f\\u0435\\u0447\\u0443\\u0454 \\u0431\\u0456\\u043b\\u044c\\u0448\\u0435 \\u043d\\u0430\\u043b\\u0430\\u0448\\u0442\\u0443\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u044c \\u0456\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u0457, \\u043f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0430\\u044e\\u0447\\u0438 \\u043e\\u0431\\u2019\\u0454\\u043a\\u0442 \\u0456\\u0437 \\u043f\\u0430\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0435\\u0442\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438:\\n\",\"margin\":\"default\",\"text_style\":\"large\"},\"name\":\"\\u041e\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\"},{\"type\":\"code\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"var app = new Techno4({\\n  routes: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'about',\\n      path: '\\/about\\/',\\n      url: '.\\/pages\\/about.html',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      name: 'news',\\n      path: '\\/news\\/',\\n      url: '.\\/pages\\/news.html',\\n      options: {\\n        animate: false,\\n      },\\n    },\\n    {\\n      name: 'users',\\n      path: '\\/users\\/',\\n      componentUrl: '.\\/pages\\/users.html',\\n      options: {\\n        props: {\\n          users: ['Techno Wizard', 'Taras Shtempo'],\\n        },\\n      },\\n      on: {\\n        pageAfterIn: function test (e, page) {\\n          \\/\\/ do something after page gets into the view\\n        },\\n        pageInit: function (e, page) {\\n          \\/\\/ do something when page initialized\\n        },\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\/\\/ Default route, match to all pages (e.g. 404 page)\\n    {\\n      path: '(.*)',\\n      url: '.\\/pages\\/404.html',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\"},\"name\":\"\\u041a\\u043e\\u0434\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u0429\\u043e\\u0431 \\u043f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u044f\\u043d\\u0443\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0441\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u043e\\u043a \\u0443\\u0441\\u0456\\u0445 \\u0434\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0443\\u043f\\u043d\\u0438\\u0445 \\u043f\\u0430\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0435\\u0442\\u0440\\u0456\\u0432 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438, \\u043f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u044f\\u043d\\u044c\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0440\\u043e\\u0437\\u0434\\u0456\\u043b \\u0414\\u043e\\u0434\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e\\u043a\\/ \\u042f\\u0434\\u0440\\u043e \",\"margin\":\"default\",\"text_style\":\"large\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u041f\\u0456\\u0441\\u043b\\u044f \\u0456\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u0457 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438 \\u043d\\u0430\\u043c \\u043f\\u043e\\u0442\\u0440\\u0456\\u0431\\u043d\\u043e \\u0456\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u0443\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u0430\\u0432\\u043b\\u0435\\u043d\\u043d\\u044f (<div class=\\\"view view-main\\\">\\n\",\"margin\":\"default\",\"text_style\":\"large\"}},{\"type\":\"code\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"view view-main\\\">\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u0443 \\u043c\\u0430\\u043a\\u0435\\u0442\\u0456 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438). \\u041f\\u043e \\u0441\\u0443\\u0442\\u0456 View \\u2014 \\u0446\\u0435 \\u043c\\u0430\\u0440\\u0448\\u0440\\u0443\\u0442\\u0438\\u0437\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0438, \\u044f\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0432\\u0456\\u0434\\u043f\\u043e\\u0432\\u0456\\u0434\\u0430\\u0454 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0432\\u0456\\u0433\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u044e:\",\"margin\":\"default\"}},{\"type\":\"code\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"var mainView = app.views.create('.view-main');\\n\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u041e\\u0442\\u0436\\u0435, \\u0432\\u0430\\u0448 \\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e\\u0447\\u043d\\u0438\\u0439 \\u043a\\u043e\\u0434 \\u0456\\u043d\\u0456\\u0446\\u0456\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456\\u0437\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u0457 \\u0432 my-app.js \\u043c\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435 \\u0432\\u0438\\u0433\\u043b\\u044f\\u0434\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0442\\u0430\\u043a:\\n\",\"margin\":\"default\",\"text_style\":\"large\"}},{\"type\":\"code\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"var app = new Techno4({\\n  \\/\\/ App root element\\n  el: '#app',\\n  \\/\\/ App Name\\n  name: 'My App',\\n  \\/\\/ App id\\n  id: 'com.myapp.test',\\n  \\/\\/ Enable swipe panel\\n  panel: {\\n    swipe: true,\\n  },\\n  \\/\\/ Add default routes\\n  routes: [\\n    {\\n      path: '\\/about\\/',\\n      url: 'about.html',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n  \\/\\/ ... other parameters\\n});\\n\\nvar mainView = app.views.create('.view-main');\\n\"}},{\"type\":\"headline\",\"props\":{\"content\":\"\\u0429\\u043e \\u0434\\u0430\\u043b\\u0456?\",\"title_element\":\"h2\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"props\":{\"column_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"content\":\"\\u0413\\u0430\\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u0434, \\u0442\\u0435\\u043f\\u0435\\u0440 \\u043c\\u0438 \\u0437\\u043d\\u0430\\u0454\\u043c\\u043e, \\u044f\\u043a \\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u043e\\u0440\\u044e\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0456 \\u0437\\u0430\\u043f\\u0443\\u0441\\u043a\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0443. \\u0422\\u0435\\u043f\\u0435\\u0440 \\u043d\\u0430\\u043c \\u043f\\u043e\\u0442\\u0440\\u0456\\u0431\\u043d\\u043e \\u043f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u0432\\u0456\\u0440\\u0438\\u0442\\u0438 \\u043a\\u043e\\u043c\\u043f\\u043e\\u043d\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442 App \\/ Core, \\u0449\\u043e\\u0431 \\u0434\\u0456\\u0437\\u043d\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438\\u0441\\u044f \\u0431\\u0456\\u043b\\u044c\\u0448\\u0435 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e \\u0439\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u043f\\u0430\\u0440\\u0430\\u043c\\u0435\\u0442\\u0440\\u0438 \\u0442\\u0430 \\u043c\\u0435\\u0442\\u043e\\u0434\\u0438, \\u044f\\u043a \\u043f\\u0440\\u0430\\u0446\\u044e\\u0454 Router, \\u0434\\u0456\\u0437\\u043d\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438\\u0441\\u044f \\u0431\\u0456\\u043b\\u044c\\u0448\\u0435 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e Views, Pages \\u0442\\u0430 \\u0456\\u043d\\u0448\\u0456 \\u043a\\u043e\\u043c\\u043f\\u043e\\u043d\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u0438.\\n\",\"margin\":\"default\"}}]},{\"type\":\"column\",\"props\":{\"image_position\":\"center-center\",\"position_sticky_breakpoint\":\"m\",\"width_medium\":\"1-4\"},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"module\",\"props\":{\"menu_image_align\":\"center\",\"menu_image_margin\":true,\"menu_style\":\"default\",\"menu_type\":\"nav\",\"module\":\"123\",\"type\":\"mod_menu\"}}]}],\"props\":{\"layout\":\"3-4,1-4\"}}],\"name\":\"\\u041f\\u0440\\u0438\\u043a\\u043b\\u0430\\u0434 \\u0434\\u043e\\u043a\\u0443\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u0430\\u0446\\u0456\\u0457 0\"}],\"version\":\"4.0.3\",\"yooessentialsVersion\":\"2.0.6\"} -->",
